WEBVTT

01:28.590 --> 01:32.300
Our Secret
EP19

01:36.970 --> 01:38.050
Is it here?

01:39.050 --> 01:41.570
Are you sure that you got rid of them?

01:42.160 --> 01:44.440
I seem to hear Song Ziqi's voice.

01:44.800 --> 01:45.800
This is not something we can afford to be careless about.

01:45.800 --> 01:47.119
If she appears at the door the next moment,

01:47.119 --> 01:48.520
I'd die, no kidding.

01:48.520 --> 01:49.200
Seriously.

01:49.290 --> 01:49.890
You have no idea

01:49.890 --> 01:51.520
that I have not slept well for the past few days.

01:51.690 --> 01:53.250
I have nightmares every night.

01:53.970 --> 01:55.160
It's here, I think.

01:56.929 --> 01:57.760
Zhou Siyue

01:58.760 --> 02:00.080
Song Ziqi, open the door.

02:01.160 --> 02:03.200
Song Ziqi, open the door.

02:03.480 --> 02:04.890
I know you're here.

02:04.970 --> 02:06.610
Don't hide in there and not speak!

02:06.930 --> 02:07.890
Song Ziqi

02:10.080 --> 02:11.000
Open the door.

02:14.000 --> 02:15.250
Shut up.

02:15.770 --> 02:16.610
Song Ziqi

02:17.410 --> 02:18.920
Song Ziqi. Get the heck out.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.440
I know you are here.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.130
Come out now.

02:29.690 --> 02:31.160
You are being suspended, so what?

02:31.610 --> 02:33.890
Do you have to hide here and get so sullen about it?

02:34.330 --> 02:36.410
Get out of the bathroom!

02:53.490 --> 02:54.210
Hello.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.560
You douchebag! You...

02:58.850 --> 02:59.920
There's no need to...

02:59.920 --> 03:00.800
Don't stop me.

03:00.800 --> 03:02.560
Shadi, calm down first.

03:02.610 --> 03:03.560
You two get out.

03:04.000 --> 03:05.360
I want to talk to him alone.

03:05.770 --> 03:06.440
No...

03:07.560 --> 03:08.250
No, you...

03:23.280 --> 03:24.330
How about

03:25.560 --> 03:27.050
I take you back to school?

03:34.770 --> 03:37.330
My bag is still in there.

03:41.250 --> 03:43.130
I'd better wait outside.

03:49.770 --> 03:51.050
Can't you go easy on me?

03:51.050 --> 03:53.160
If you hurt me, I won't be able to become a pilot.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.130
You still want to be a pilot?

03:56.330 --> 03:57.440
Aren't you trying to stay away from everyone?

03:57.610 --> 03:58.719
Aren't you running away?

04:00.520 --> 04:01.520
You didn't pick up your phone.

04:02.560 --> 04:03.690
Your QQ is off-line.

04:05.050 --> 04:05.890
And you just sent me a message,

04:05.920 --> 04:07.490
telling me that I should never try to find you.

04:07.890 --> 04:09.250
Song Ziqi, who do you think you are?

04:09.410 --> 04:11.130
Why did you treat me like that?

04:11.280 --> 04:11.920
I am sorry.

04:12.080 --> 04:13.280
Sorry?

04:14.970 --> 04:16.440
You are just being suspended.

04:16.490 --> 04:17.719
Big deal?

04:17.930 --> 04:19.560
Do you need to avoid me like the plague?

04:19.650 --> 04:21.050
Calm down.

04:21.050 --> 04:22.400
I can't calm down.

04:23.490 --> 04:25.440
Can't you just man up?

04:27.440 --> 04:29.330
You said you wanted to be with me.

04:31.440 --> 04:33.610
You said you wanted to be a pilot.

04:33.960 --> 04:36.210
And it was you who insisted on our long-distance relationship.

04:37.440 --> 04:39.720
And now, something went wrong.

04:40.120 --> 04:42.160
All you want to do is to hide. Not dare to confront it.

04:42.400 --> 04:43.960
Song Ziqi, are you still a man?

04:44.090 --> 04:45.000
Enough!

05:03.050 --> 05:03.770
Ding Xian

05:04.650 --> 05:05.560
Actually...

05:06.000 --> 05:06.810
Sweet potatoes.

05:13.400 --> 05:15.090
Boss, give me a sweet potato please.

05:15.330 --> 05:16.240
Ten yuan for two.

05:16.770 --> 05:17.330
Okay.

05:21.960 --> 05:23.090
I forgot my bag.

05:23.330 --> 05:24.280
You forgot to bring your money?

05:26.090 --> 05:28.050
Young man, your girlfriend doesn't have money with her.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.840
Come and pay!

05:37.560 --> 05:38.490
Song Ziqi

05:39.400 --> 05:40.650
I miss you.

05:42.490 --> 05:44.160
Go back.

05:44.770 --> 05:46.330
I'm late for the flight already.

05:47.610 --> 05:48.890
Then catch the next one.

05:52.840 --> 05:54.610
Are you kidding me?

05:56.560 --> 05:58.330
Go back, please.

05:58.440 --> 05:59.810
I am not going back.

06:00.400 --> 06:02.400
I can't let you run away anymore.

06:04.560 --> 06:06.680
So, are you here to save me?

06:09.280 --> 06:10.000
I...

06:11.120 --> 06:12.680
I came for the money!

06:13.770 --> 06:14.650
What money?

06:14.770 --> 06:15.930
100 yuan for a kiss.

06:16.330 --> 06:18.050
You can count how many times you kissed me.

06:19.840 --> 06:20.530
Hold on.

06:24.400 --> 06:25.560
Enough?

06:26.720 --> 06:28.370
If it is not enough, I will give you my credit card.

06:28.770 --> 06:30.810
Take it.

06:33.330 --> 06:34.330
You douchebag!

06:47.680 --> 06:48.650
Thank you.

06:49.680 --> 06:51.330
I will pay you back later.

06:52.720 --> 06:53.560
No need.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.120
Shadi

07:17.930 --> 07:19.000
Did you see Shadi?

07:19.960 --> 07:21.000
Isn't she inside?

07:21.090 --> 07:21.930
No, she just rushed out.

07:22.000 --> 07:22.650
Did you see her?

07:22.840 --> 07:23.720
No.

08:06.930 --> 08:08.240
Call her.

08:08.400 --> 08:09.530
She won't pick up.

08:11.330 --> 08:12.490
What are you guys doing?

08:13.490 --> 08:14.160
Shadi

08:15.000 --> 08:15.960
I am sorry. It was my fault.

08:16.120 --> 08:17.890
I wasn't thinking straight. That wasn't me.

08:18.090 --> 08:19.000
I am sorry, Shadi.

08:19.120 --> 08:19.890
Song Ziqi, let go of me.

08:19.960 --> 08:20.770
No, I won't.

08:21.090 --> 08:21.680
No.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.240
You don't know anything but running around.

08:25.610 --> 08:26.770
If something really happens to you,

08:30.440 --> 08:30.960
I...

08:32.160 --> 08:33.360
You, what about you?

08:35.439 --> 08:36.679
I... I also don't know.

08:53.560 --> 08:55.770
If Ding Xian is really not around me anymore,

08:57.120 --> 08:59.000
I think I will be so scared.

09:09.530 --> 09:10.440
Let me do it.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.000
No need for the courtesy with me.

09:14.120 --> 09:15.090
I am leaving. Don't cry alone

09:15.240 --> 09:16.680
in the basement.

09:24.890 --> 09:25.920
You should speak out

09:26.560 --> 09:27.680
the things you need to say.

09:30.170 --> 09:31.210
Got it.

09:32.890 --> 09:34.410
Xianxian, I miss you so much.

09:34.410 --> 09:35.410
Me too.

09:35.800 --> 09:38.560
Maybe you guys should stay for two more days.

09:38.730 --> 09:39.730
That's not okay.

09:39.970 --> 09:42.120
If we stay for two more days, Song Ziqi will run away again.

09:42.530 --> 09:43.360
And,

09:43.650 --> 09:46.090
we should let him get back and apologize to his parents at least.

09:47.290 --> 09:48.920
I don't think he'll dare to do it again.

09:49.090 --> 09:50.170
Rest assured.

09:51.170 --> 09:52.360
Then, you...

09:52.530 --> 09:53.240
Zhou Siyue,

09:53.800 --> 09:56.000
if anything happens to Xianxian,

09:56.040 --> 09:57.410
I will come back and get you.

09:58.210 --> 09:58.920
Don't worry.

09:59.530 --> 10:00.330
She'll not get lost.

10:00.650 --> 10:01.480
Glad to hear it.

10:05.530 --> 10:06.650
You, come over.

10:06.970 --> 10:07.850
What?

10:08.800 --> 10:11.090
So, are we good now?

10:12.240 --> 10:13.330
Are you dreaming?

10:13.770 --> 10:15.000
How long have I been searching for you?

10:15.360 --> 10:17.480
You need to make it up to me twice as much.

10:21.600 --> 10:22.530
We are leaving now.

10:22.970 --> 10:24.000
Be safe. Bye.

10:24.330 --> 10:25.210
Don't cry.

10:26.330 --> 10:27.360
Hurry up.

10:27.890 --> 10:28.680
Take care.

10:41.530 --> 10:42.890
Let me take you back to school.

10:45.530 --> 10:47.970
No need. I can walk back to school myself.

11:29.120 --> 11:30.360
I'd leave now.

12:30.600 --> 12:32.360
If you are busy in school,

12:33.090 --> 12:34.730
you don't need to come here so frequently.

12:35.040 --> 12:36.680
Your mom and I are fine.

12:38.850 --> 12:40.170
I can spare some time.

12:41.850 --> 12:42.650
Right.

12:44.770 --> 12:46.730
Ding Xian is also in Hua Qing now.

12:52.210 --> 12:53.600
I like this girl.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.480
She has a spirit.

12:57.170 --> 12:58.090
Extraordinary.

13:06.170 --> 13:07.650
I'm holding you up.

13:09.170 --> 13:10.920
I didn't mean that.

13:15.680 --> 13:17.560
It is just that I don't think it is the right time yet.

13:17.800 --> 13:19.850
What do you mean, "not the right time"?

13:20.440 --> 13:23.170
When is the right time then?

13:28.480 --> 13:29.650
When I was young,

13:31.730 --> 13:34.000
I needed to go to Jiangling to teach.

13:34.680 --> 13:38.090
I wanted to take you and your mom with me.

13:38.530 --> 13:39.920
But your mom,

13:40.530 --> 13:43.090
since she was used to living a stable life,

13:43.360 --> 13:45.920
she didn't want to move around with me.

13:47.120 --> 13:48.890
I thought that as a family,

13:49.090 --> 13:51.530
we shouldn't live separately in two different places.

13:53.890 --> 13:55.480
But she was stubborn.

13:56.680 --> 13:58.330
She wouldn't agree no matter what.

13:59.210 --> 14:01.850
In the end, we dropped this matter.

14:03.210 --> 14:04.330
Regarding this,

14:05.170 --> 14:06.680
we have argued

14:07.290 --> 14:09.290
for many times.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.170
I used to think

14:13.170 --> 14:15.560
that she wouldn't be able to carry on in Shenhai,

14:15.770 --> 14:17.440
raising you all by herself.

14:17.530 --> 14:19.480
She would come to me one day.

14:20.240 --> 14:21.560
Only later did I find out

14:23.560 --> 14:24.920
that I had underestimated her.

14:26.290 --> 14:28.440
Not only did she bring you up,

14:29.360 --> 14:31.560
but also raised you to be such an excellent man.

14:32.850 --> 14:35.330
I don't know, for so many years,

14:35.920 --> 14:37.650
how much she has been through

14:38.680 --> 14:40.000
and how much she has suffered.

14:42.290 --> 14:43.770
Not until this accident

14:45.240 --> 14:46.770
did it dawn on me

14:48.170 --> 14:50.120
that your mom has always been

14:50.330 --> 14:51.850
a capable woman.

14:52.480 --> 14:53.890
In order to take care of me,

14:54.970 --> 14:57.410
she put away the obsession for so many years

14:57.680 --> 15:00.770
and came to Jiangling,

15:01.480 --> 15:03.330
busy around without a single complaint.

15:04.330 --> 15:05.410
Every time,

15:07.210 --> 15:09.800
I see her sleep when she is exhausted,

15:10.480 --> 15:11.480
I would think,

15:12.650 --> 15:15.360
why did I have to come to Jiangling

15:15.530 --> 15:17.330
to be a professor?

15:19.480 --> 15:20.560
Why did I

15:24.410 --> 15:27.970
have to keep her waiting for me?

15:35.650 --> 15:36.600
Let's get inside.

15:36.890 --> 15:38.170
There is a draft here.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.890
You may catch a cold.

15:46.360 --> 15:47.410
I believe,

15:49.730 --> 15:51.530
wherever my son goes,

15:52.120 --> 15:54.240
he will be successful.

15:54.650 --> 15:56.560
But I don't want you

15:57.240 --> 15:58.170
to find

15:58.210 --> 16:00.360
that you are all alone

16:01.170 --> 16:03.800
after you succeed.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.730
Don't make your mom and me

16:10.850 --> 16:12.560
an excuse of your own business.

16:13.210 --> 16:14.360
We are great.

16:14.800 --> 16:15.890
You don't need to worry about us.

16:19.970 --> 16:20.890
Alright.

16:21.530 --> 16:22.890
Go back if you don't have other things.

17:02.800 --> 17:03.730
Boss,

17:04.330 --> 17:06.410
you finally admit.

17:07.200 --> 17:10.120
I knew it! You have feelings for Ding Xian all along!

17:10.650 --> 17:11.530
Fine.

17:12.239 --> 17:13.479
Just tell me whether you will help me or not.

17:13.650 --> 17:15.320
Of course.

17:15.570 --> 17:17.570
I am good at chasing girls.

17:23.120 --> 17:24.450
Hello, guys.

17:24.810 --> 17:27.600
We are Love Chasing League from now on.

17:27.959 --> 17:30.450
Then I am Love.

17:30.690 --> 17:31.840
I am Chasing.

17:32.960 --> 17:35.690
You are League.

17:36.450 --> 17:38.890
I'd be brain-damaged to ask you two for help.

17:38.960 --> 17:39.650
Hurry.

17:39.810 --> 17:41.080
Don't rush.

17:41.410 --> 17:43.000
I have already learned

17:44.170 --> 17:46.930
that members of the Anime Club are going to participate

17:47.290 --> 17:49.410
in a Comic-con in Huai City.

17:50.170 --> 17:55.080
And there is a great amusement park in Huai City.

17:55.840 --> 17:57.080
Amusement park, great idea.

17:57.320 --> 17:57.890
You see.

17:57.890 --> 18:00.600
You can grab her hand when you're on the roller coaster.

18:00.720 --> 18:01.410
Go to the haunted house.

18:01.450 --> 18:03.930
When she gets scared in the haunted house, she'll hug you.

18:04.960 --> 18:06.650
Last time I took Kong Shadi there,

18:06.840 --> 18:09.120
she screamed and hugged me right away.

18:09.360 --> 18:11.000
What are you talking about?

18:12.050 --> 18:13.240
I am out now.

18:18.600 --> 18:19.290
Boss.

18:20.890 --> 18:22.480
Are you still chasing love now?

18:25.080 --> 18:25.960
Yes.

18:30.810 --> 18:31.600
Come in.

18:35.080 --> 18:35.720
Mr. Su.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.770
About the science expo of Robot Competition in Huai City,

18:37.840 --> 18:39.080
its exhibits have already been prepared.

18:39.320 --> 18:40.200
Please take a look.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.840
Have you booked the ticket to Huai City?

18:49.000 --> 18:50.690
Yes, nine o'clock tomorrow night.

18:54.690 --> 18:55.720
Reschedule it to the morning.

18:56.200 --> 18:56.960
Okay.

19:04.650 --> 19:05.170
Thanks.

19:05.530 --> 19:06.720
Get on quickly. Okay.

19:07.720 --> 19:08.720
Sorry, Lou Feng.

19:08.930 --> 19:10.290
Ji Hang happened to have other things to do.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.050
So we asked for your help.

19:12.200 --> 19:14.240
That's okay. I am free, anyway.

19:14.360 --> 19:16.080
I just took it as a free trip.

19:16.120 --> 19:17.290
Alright, then I should get on first.

19:17.360 --> 19:18.000
Hurry.

19:21.480 --> 19:22.690
Good morning, Lou Feng.

19:24.600 --> 19:26.600
Do you know why the head of the Anime Club

19:26.720 --> 19:27.810
doesn't come this time?

19:29.050 --> 19:30.530
Isn't it because he has other business to do?

19:31.050 --> 19:32.200
Are you silly?

19:32.960 --> 19:35.170
Can't you tell that he likes Xing Lufei?

19:36.410 --> 19:39.080
I heard that Ji Hang

19:39.240 --> 19:41.200
has a crush on her Xing Lufei for years.

19:41.530 --> 19:43.600
But he can only watch her

19:43.810 --> 19:45.770
falling in love with other people again and again.

19:46.410 --> 19:48.200
And some time ago, he confessed his love to her.

19:48.290 --> 19:49.050
Guess what?

19:49.050 --> 19:50.320
What?

19:50.770 --> 19:51.720
Xing said,

19:52.450 --> 19:55.050
"I thought we were good friends."

20:05.770 --> 20:06.530
Good morning.

20:06.600 --> 20:07.720
Morning, Yuan Fang.

20:07.840 --> 20:08.570
Good morning.

20:08.570 --> 20:09.360
Xianxian.

20:12.290 --> 20:13.170
Do you need my help?

20:13.290 --> 20:13.890
No.

20:20.320 --> 20:21.320
I want some.

20:21.930 --> 20:22.930
Here you go.

20:27.450 --> 20:30.840
Xing Lufei is really something.

20:31.450 --> 20:33.840
Doesn't she keep harassing your Zhou?

20:34.240 --> 20:35.570
You need to be careful.

20:37.770 --> 20:39.360
Speak of the devil.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.690
Why are you here?

20:48.890 --> 20:50.770
There are only five members in the robot team.

20:51.480 --> 20:52.240
That's okay.

20:52.480 --> 20:54.600
I have talked to Professor Ye.

20:55.600 --> 20:57.360
I thought you wouldn't come today.

20:57.810 --> 20:58.720
Zhou Siyue,

20:59.050 --> 21:01.050
how do you know that I am going to Huai City?

21:01.530 --> 21:03.480
No, it is not because of you.

21:03.690 --> 21:04.840
Boss comes because of...

21:10.170 --> 21:12.080
Xing Lufei

21:12.360 --> 21:14.650
is really obsessed with Zhou.

21:16.290 --> 21:16.960
Let's go.

21:17.960 --> 21:19.720
Zhou Siyue, have an apple.

21:20.290 --> 21:21.480
No, thanks. I am not hungry.

21:21.690 --> 21:23.450
You are not hungry now, but you can still save it for tonight.

21:23.450 --> 21:24.000
Here you are.

21:27.480 --> 21:28.410
Xing

21:29.050 --> 21:30.650
Have you heard of

21:30.890 --> 21:31.890
an old saying?

21:32.050 --> 21:32.810
What?

21:33.480 --> 21:36.080
Apples should be eaten in the morning.

21:36.480 --> 21:39.200
In the morning, the apple you eat is a golden one.

21:39.360 --> 21:41.410
In the afternoon, it becomes a silver one.

21:41.840 --> 21:43.240
At night,

21:43.770 --> 21:45.530
it becomes a poisonous one.

21:46.690 --> 21:48.770
That's too far-fetched.

21:48.960 --> 21:49.720
That's real.

21:49.890 --> 21:51.690
An old man in our village liked to eat apples at night.

21:51.840 --> 21:52.600
Later...

21:54.080 --> 21:55.690
What happened later?

21:56.720 --> 21:57.690
Later,

21:59.080 --> 22:00.200
he died.

22:01.120 --> 22:02.200
Nonsense.

22:03.200 --> 22:04.120
Fine.

22:04.320 --> 22:05.890
Aren't you sleepy?

22:06.120 --> 22:06.930
Take some sleep.

22:24.360 --> 22:25.050
We are here.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.650
I am so hungry now.

22:28.530 --> 22:29.200
Let's go.

22:30.120 --> 22:32.890
Instant noodles with an egg, bad luck comes to an end.

22:34.530 --> 22:35.930
The weather is so nice today.

22:37.050 --> 22:38.930
I want to have a spicy chicken burger.

22:39.570 --> 22:40.530
Sure.

22:40.690 --> 22:41.570
Xianxian.

22:42.770 --> 22:45.000
Who is this? Why did he call you "Xianxian"?

22:45.080 --> 22:46.890
He was a senior in my high school.

22:47.410 --> 22:48.120
Su

22:48.170 --> 22:50.200
Bocong, you are here so early?

22:51.890 --> 22:52.720
The rooms for the Anime Club

22:52.770 --> 22:54.000
have been arranged properly.

22:54.120 --> 22:55.480
You can just bring in your luggage and check in.

22:56.080 --> 22:56.890
Thanks.

22:57.480 --> 23:00.890
Xianxian, Bocong is not only handsome and rich,

23:01.290 --> 23:02.450
but also favors you.

23:02.890 --> 23:04.290
You should not let the chance slip away.

23:04.290 --> 23:05.240
I'd better get inside first.

23:08.290 --> 23:09.930
- Are you tired? - I'm fine.

23:10.770 --> 23:11.770
I can carry it myself.

23:12.600 --> 23:13.450
Su

23:14.170 --> 23:15.170
What are the odds?

23:15.960 --> 23:17.000
Long time no see.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.170
Your job covers quite a wide range now.

23:20.650 --> 23:22.290
You need to receive the guests too?

23:23.600 --> 23:25.000
I am here for Xianxian.

23:26.120 --> 23:28.570
Right, the Robot Competition you join

23:28.840 --> 23:30.450
is sponsored by Red Horse.

23:31.890 --> 23:33.240
Red Horse seems to always be like this,

23:34.050 --> 23:36.050
getting involved in everything.

23:37.650 --> 23:39.840
But you need to have strength to get involved.

23:40.360 --> 23:42.450
I am looking forward to your performance in the competition.

23:43.080 --> 23:44.690
You don't need to worry about that.

23:46.450 --> 23:47.290
Yuan Fang

23:48.320 --> 23:49.120
Hurry up.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.770
-Here. -Xianxian, have you eaten yet?

23:51.530 --> 23:52.450
I know.

23:52.450 --> 23:53.600
Not yet.

23:55.570 --> 23:58.170
It is shameless to keep harassing others!

23:59.600 --> 24:00.600
What are you talking about?

24:02.600 --> 24:03.530
Sorry about that.

24:04.290 --> 24:05.600
I arrived. I'll call you later.

24:07.720 --> 24:09.890
Are you Mr. Su of Red Horse Tech?

24:11.050 --> 24:12.200
You are?

24:13.120 --> 24:14.930
You can give my luggage to me.

24:15.200 --> 24:17.320
I am going inside now. I'll leave you guys to your business.

24:17.930 --> 24:18.720
Let's go.

24:19.360 --> 24:19.890
Hello.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.720
Excuse me for a moment.

24:22.450 --> 24:23.080
Xianxian.

24:25.890 --> 24:27.120
Do you want to have dinner with me tonight?

24:27.810 --> 24:29.450
It is probably not okay tonight.

24:29.650 --> 24:30.890
I need to beat the deadline of the draft.

24:31.930 --> 24:33.890
That's okay. I'll ask the hotel to bring you dinner.

24:34.240 --> 24:36.290
By the way, my room number is 902.

24:36.320 --> 24:38.410
You can find me whenever you want.

24:39.170 --> 24:40.650
- Sure. - Go get some rest.

24:41.000 --> 24:41.890
Bye bye.

24:41.890 --> 24:42.450
Bye bye.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.570
He even told you his room number,

24:45.600 --> 24:47.000
and you said he is just a senior of your old school?

24:47.170 --> 24:47.690
Yeah.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.770
Mr. Su, hello.

24:50.050 --> 24:50.570
Hello.

24:51.840 --> 24:54.080
I heard that Red Horse Tech is sponsoring this competition.

24:54.600 --> 24:56.410
And I have always looked forward to meeting you.

24:56.570 --> 24:58.410
It never occurs to me that I can meet you here.

25:01.810 --> 25:02.840
This is my name card.

25:04.320 --> 25:05.770
I am sorry, but I have something to do now.

25:05.810 --> 25:07.410
Let's talk in details later.

25:07.530 --> 25:08.120
Sure.

25:14.120 --> 25:16.320
Zhou Siyue of Hua Qing Scientific Research Group?

25:17.450 --> 25:18.200
It is me.

25:18.570 --> 25:20.720
Hello, Professor Ye called me just now.

25:20.770 --> 25:22.480
He asked me to discuss things about the competition with you.

25:23.080 --> 25:24.000
Sure. No problem.

25:25.290 --> 25:26.200
Can I have your phone number?

25:26.240 --> 25:27.890
For contact. Is that okay?

25:28.080 --> 25:28.690
Sure.

25:36.690 --> 25:37.960
It seems that no matter where a handsome guy goes,

25:38.000 --> 25:39.450
he can get special treatment.

25:41.690 --> 25:42.570
Are you finished?

25:45.080 --> 25:45.930
That's it.

25:46.000 --> 25:46.890
Okay. Thanks.

25:47.360 --> 25:48.530
Please rest well.

25:48.810 --> 25:49.770
- Bye. - Hello.

25:50.000 --> 25:50.840
I am Yuan Fang.

26:27.410 --> 26:28.360
What are you doing?

26:29.770 --> 26:30.770
Full.

26:30.930 --> 26:31.890
Not yet.

26:35.480 --> 26:36.650
Now it is full.

26:49.290 --> 26:51.450
What plan do you have for tomorrow?

26:52.410 --> 26:53.650
I'll take you to a place.

26:55.690 --> 26:56.650
What are you trying to do?

26:58.050 --> 26:59.360
I want to date you.

27:01.810 --> 27:02.890
I am not available tomorrow.

27:05.600 --> 27:07.200
Not available at any time.

27:09.600 --> 27:10.480
Fine.

27:11.890 --> 27:13.450
Then tell me where you are going tomorrow?

27:14.050 --> 27:15.120
I'll go find you.

27:29.000 --> 27:31.080
Can you stop pestering me?

27:32.890 --> 27:34.810
You hate talking to me that much?

27:35.480 --> 27:37.720
There is nothing for us to talk about now.

27:44.290 --> 27:45.840
Zhou Siyue, don't be such a rascal.

27:49.650 --> 27:51.290
Give me a chance to explain.

28:01.080 --> 28:03.050
Actually, about what you said to Su Bocong that day,

28:03.050 --> 28:04.080
I heard it all.

28:09.120 --> 28:11.480
So, when I knew how hard and exhausting it was for you

28:11.770 --> 28:13.050
as a Senior Three returnee in that year,

28:13.050 --> 28:14.480
and it was all because of me,

28:16.570 --> 28:17.810
I hesitated.

28:20.120 --> 28:21.530
I thought that if I push you away,

28:22.360 --> 28:24.480
you could find your own life.

28:25.530 --> 28:27.200
I thought that what I did was for your good.

28:28.170 --> 28:29.960
That was why I took the liberty to make all the decisions.

28:32.770 --> 28:34.320
Actually, for these days,

28:36.000 --> 28:37.810
I have always been questioning myself.

28:41.890 --> 28:43.530
I was afraid of seeing you.

28:47.690 --> 28:49.480
I was afraid that when you see me,

28:49.930 --> 28:51.290
you will be disappointed at me.

28:52.570 --> 28:53.450
Because I am no longer

28:53.530 --> 28:55.080
the old Zhou Siyue.

28:56.050 --> 28:57.000
Not the Zhou Siyue

28:59.170 --> 29:01.410
who can lend you energy.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.720
That was why I chose to run away from you.

29:09.570 --> 29:10.650
But later,

29:12.320 --> 29:13.810
when you came to Hua Qing,

29:16.000 --> 29:17.720
and you showed up around me,

29:22.200 --> 29:23.840
I couldn't help caring about you.

29:27.930 --> 29:30.770
I just couldn't help picturing our future.

29:32.000 --> 29:32.930
But this future

29:33.120 --> 29:34.690
should never be a future that need you to sacrifice

29:34.890 --> 29:37.410
what you like for my sake.

29:41.170 --> 29:43.290
Actually I just want you to understand this.

29:43.840 --> 29:46.450
And don't just ignore me like this.

29:47.930 --> 29:49.360
Are you done?

29:53.600 --> 29:54.480
Yes.

30:00.120 --> 30:01.200
I have thought about

30:01.200 --> 30:02.690
what you said.

30:04.050 --> 30:06.530
You are afraid that uncle's thing will affect me.

30:07.120 --> 30:08.600
That I can understand.

30:09.770 --> 30:11.720
But I have never been afraid of that.

30:13.410 --> 30:15.690
You said you wanted to go abroad, trying to push me away.

30:15.930 --> 30:16.840
Then I would deal with

30:16.890 --> 30:19.000
your worries about a long-distance relationship.

30:19.690 --> 30:21.690
As for the opinions of the people in the university,

30:21.960 --> 30:23.320
I won't care about them.

30:24.600 --> 30:25.890
I chased after you so hard

30:25.890 --> 30:27.170
for a simple reason.

30:29.450 --> 30:30.890
That is, I like you.

30:33.690 --> 30:35.450
But now I understand

30:37.080 --> 30:39.480
that a true relationship is neck and neck.

30:40.600 --> 30:41.890
But not that you come to tell me,

30:41.960 --> 30:43.240
what to do at a time,

30:43.410 --> 30:44.960
and what not to do at another time.

30:48.480 --> 30:49.480
Zhou Siyue

30:52.840 --> 30:53.840
Have you ever thought about

30:53.840 --> 30:56.320
what really love is?

31:01.240 --> 31:02.960
Zhou Siyue, there you are.

31:03.290 --> 31:04.650
I happen to have something to ask you.

31:09.810 --> 31:10.690
Ding Xian.

31:15.080 --> 31:16.530
What are you guys doing here?

31:18.840 --> 31:19.720
Wait a second.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.600
Zhou Siyue,

31:23.000 --> 31:24.810
you don't really like Ding Xian, do you?

31:28.120 --> 31:29.120
I like her.

31:30.120 --> 31:31.080
So what?

31:42.320 --> 31:43.240
Boss.

31:44.410 --> 31:45.890
That's not going to work.

31:46.410 --> 31:48.690
Ding Xian just rejected you right away.

31:49.120 --> 31:51.840
Then our plans are of no use.

31:56.450 --> 31:58.930
Do you know how to contact Ding Xian's roommate?

32:00.840 --> 32:01.810
Lou Feng.

32:13.170 --> 32:14.650
So what's in it for me?

32:16.240 --> 32:20.050
Aren't you in Professor Ye's Scientific Research Group?

32:20.570 --> 32:22.360
There is a course taught by Professor Ye

32:22.720 --> 32:24.120
that I can't sign up no matter what.

32:26.120 --> 32:27.770
Don't go too far.

32:27.930 --> 32:30.170
I am just an intern myself.

32:30.530 --> 32:31.480
I will take care of it.

32:32.720 --> 32:34.240
Zhou promised.

32:34.770 --> 32:36.600
Your request will be fulfilled.

32:44.930 --> 32:46.890
Feng, who were you calling just now?

32:48.240 --> 32:49.360
An old classmate of mine.

32:49.840 --> 32:51.650
Isn't the Comic-con the day after tomorrow?

32:51.890 --> 32:54.050
Let's go have some fun tomorrow?

32:54.690 --> 32:55.570
Okay.

32:56.410 --> 32:57.290
Where should we go?

32:58.080 --> 32:59.320
Just leave it to me.

33:12.960 --> 33:14.690
Where are you, Lou Feng?

33:17.120 --> 33:18.840
Alright, just hurry.

33:27.170 --> 33:28.320
Good for you.

33:29.570 --> 33:31.290
Bribed my roommate?

33:31.480 --> 33:32.320
It seems

33:33.450 --> 33:35.480
that everyone wants to help me.

33:40.960 --> 33:43.200
The tickets are bought already.

33:43.690 --> 33:44.530
You are really not going?

33:47.530 --> 33:50.170
You have come so far away.

33:51.890 --> 33:53.200
The tickets are quite expensive.

33:54.840 --> 33:55.770
Fine.

33:56.650 --> 33:57.810
But let me be clear.

33:58.290 --> 33:59.410
It's just hanging around.

34:00.120 --> 34:02.080
Don't you hold any other thoughts about me.

34:02.600 --> 34:03.570
Whatever you say.

34:12.890 --> 34:14.170
Let's see where we should have fun.

34:20.600 --> 34:22.250
Boss, how is it?

34:24.560 --> 34:27.520
Got inside. But we don't know where to go.

34:33.040 --> 34:34.120
Take her to the haunted house.

34:37.279 --> 34:39.560
Yes, take her there.

34:44.080 --> 34:46.170
But I don't see one.

34:47.250 --> 34:50.010
Hello, can I add your WeChat?

34:50.890 --> 34:51.730
Sorry.

34:52.560 --> 34:53.839
I already have a girlfriend.

34:59.120 --> 35:00.450
Why do you walk so fast?

35:02.280 --> 35:03.450
If you don't want to get around,

35:03.450 --> 35:04.840
I can go myself.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.490
How is it possible that I don't want to have fun?

35:09.410 --> 35:11.250
Then tell me, what do you want to play?

35:19.280 --> 35:20.760
What a huge maze!

35:32.450 --> 35:36.250
We are in a Children's Park today, aren't we?

35:44.520 --> 35:46.600
That's why there is not a haunted house.

35:48.120 --> 35:49.040
What did you say?

35:51.970 --> 35:53.360
What children's park?

35:54.010 --> 35:56.120
It is for both adults and children.

35:57.800 --> 35:59.650
Are you afraid of going into a maze?

35:59.930 --> 36:02.800
How could I be afraid of that?

36:02.890 --> 36:04.800
Then shall we compete?

36:06.010 --> 36:07.800
See who gets out of the maze first.

36:08.650 --> 36:09.840
If I get out first,

36:10.120 --> 36:11.320
you'll promise me

36:11.930 --> 36:13.490
not to ignore me from now on.

36:14.970 --> 36:15.890
Okay.

36:16.490 --> 36:18.280
But if I get out first?

36:18.690 --> 36:20.650
Then whatever you ask me to do, I'll do it.

36:22.170 --> 36:23.890
Deal.

36:24.360 --> 36:25.360
Deal.

36:34.450 --> 36:35.800
Left, or right?

36:48.840 --> 36:49.970
Why do you grin?

36:51.010 --> 36:52.690
I feel that you are still the same as usual.

36:52.970 --> 36:54.320
Didn't change at all.

36:57.360 --> 36:58.450
I am warning you.

36:58.890 --> 37:00.650
Don't try to touch me.

37:02.560 --> 37:04.170
I am going that way. Don't follow me.

37:18.800 --> 37:22.120
I just came here, didn't I?

37:25.250 --> 37:26.360
Zhou Siyue

37:27.650 --> 37:28.490
Ding Xian

37:35.490 --> 37:36.410
I'm here.

37:38.080 --> 37:38.970
Don't be scared.

37:40.360 --> 37:41.320
I am not.

37:43.490 --> 37:44.490
I am worried

37:45.080 --> 37:45.970
that you can't find your way.

37:49.650 --> 37:51.690
Go. Lead the way.

37:53.600 --> 37:54.490
This way.

38:04.080 --> 38:06.560
The air outside is great.

38:08.760 --> 38:09.690
I won.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.250
What?

38:11.970 --> 38:13.410
I got out first.

38:17.120 --> 38:19.360
Fine, but that was because I let you win.

38:20.080 --> 38:21.280
You let me win?

38:21.450 --> 38:22.930
I won.

38:24.690 --> 38:27.010
What? You don't think it's fair?

38:29.490 --> 38:30.490
Kind of.

38:31.250 --> 38:32.650
Then, let's have another match.

38:33.210 --> 38:35.410
Sure. Let's do it.

39:38.250 --> 39:38.970
Thank you.

39:50.930 --> 39:51.600
Here.

39:52.410 --> 39:53.320
Thank you.

39:54.320 --> 39:55.250
You are welcome.

40:02.450 --> 40:03.520
What are you looking at?

40:08.320 --> 40:11.280
When I was a child, my parents took me to an amusement park.

40:11.840 --> 40:13.250
I also wanted a balloon.

40:15.010 --> 40:16.280
But my mom didn't allow me to.

40:18.930 --> 40:20.560
But she bought one for my brother.

40:30.210 --> 40:30.890
Right.

40:32.360 --> 40:34.010
I won in the maze game.

40:34.250 --> 40:35.890
I haven't punished you yet.

40:37.210 --> 40:38.560
What do you want me to do?

40:43.360 --> 40:44.080
What?

40:44.520 --> 40:46.170
Play a mascot for me.

40:47.890 --> 40:49.170
I, Zhou Siyue,

40:49.930 --> 40:51.320
play a mascot for you?

40:54.080 --> 40:55.600
Are you kidding me?

42:17.080 --> 42:18.040
Sorry.

42:19.280 --> 42:20.410
Why did you apologize to me?

42:23.360 --> 42:24.280
I wanted

42:25.080 --> 42:26.360
to give you all.

42:28.760 --> 42:30.560
But there is only one left.

42:31.560 --> 42:33.490
Actually, one is enough.

42:35.010 --> 42:35.890
What?

42:39.080 --> 42:39.970
Nothing.

42:42.600 --> 42:43.520
So?

42:44.170 --> 42:45.690
Do you still have anything you want to play?

43:15.840 --> 43:16.800
Were you caught in the rain?

43:17.690 --> 43:18.490
No.

43:30.450 --> 43:31.520
Wait for me here.

43:34.890 --> 43:37.170
A cup of hot coco, and paper tissue, please.

43:46.840 --> 43:47.560
No, thanks.

43:51.410 --> 43:52.170
Thank you.

43:54.650 --> 43:55.890
Your back is all wet.

43:58.890 --> 44:00.690
I'll do it myself.

44:01.010 --> 44:01.690
Stay still.

44:09.690 --> 44:11.120
Why are your ears so red?

44:13.490 --> 44:14.320
So hot.

44:15.840 --> 44:17.360
Your hands are so cold.

44:25.120 --> 44:29.080
It seems to be the second time that we get caught in a rain.

44:31.490 --> 44:32.600
Do you still remember

44:34.840 --> 44:37.320
when we got caught in the rain the first time?

44:38.890 --> 44:39.730
I do.

44:42.170 --> 44:43.170
When we were sophomores

44:45.280 --> 44:47.520
We went to watch the movie 2012.

44:49.890 --> 44:51.690
And we almost bumped into Mr. Liu.

44:56.320 --> 44:57.210
Then...

44:58.250 --> 45:00.170
The end-of-the-world fireworks

45:02.450 --> 45:04.010
was set by you?

45:12.970 --> 45:13.890
Thank you.

45:17.010 --> 45:18.760
The end-of-the-world fireworks

45:19.890 --> 45:22.410
gave me a reason to apply for Hua Qing University again.
